WHOLESALE TRADE
Wholesale Trade refers to the trade in which goods are sold in large
quantities.
Wholesaler buys the goods directly from the manufacturer in bulk
and sells them in small lots to the retailer.
A wholesaler acts as a middleman between the manufacturer and
the retailer.
