WHOLESALE TRADE
Services of the Wholesalers
Services to Manufacturer
Expert advice: The wholesaler provides information
regarding the preferences and expectations of the
customers to the manufacturer. He also collects
information regarding the products of competitors, price
of their product, make suggestions about the types and
quality of goods required by the consumers.
Storage: Wholesalers provide facility of storage of goods
by buying the goods in bulk. Wholesalers take the complete
responsibility of storage of goods and bear the risk of
theft or spoilage, etc.
